          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of straight lines at sunset near the horizon: observation of condensation trails from commercial aircraft.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "ebb5a560fa514cc67a852355be3b5a59e25ba8d737397531ca28468e8f7b66f7"
